WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:04.750
Have you ever wondered about the secret&nbsp;
desire of SCP-418, the Human Jigsaw?

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.790
SCP Foundation researchers snapped a photo&nbsp;
of him with SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:14.170
while he was eating Foundation rations with&nbsp;
a plastic spoon, and this was the result:

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:19.150
"Eating a steak in a casino. A stack of&nbsp;
poker chips can also be seen on the table."

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:24.430
Another look into the mind of an anomaly&nbsp;
contained by the SCP Foundation, and a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:30.250
reminder that sometimes the things we desire most&nbsp;
are the simple comforts we once took for granted.

